{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_14114320","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"14114320","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:4:1411432001:3":{"text":"아주 오래 전, 어떤 이유로 참혹한 전쟁이 벌어졌습니다.","source_cn":"很久以前，因为种种原因，有一场很惨烈的战争。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x392F6494E475B31C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1411432002:0":{"text":"뭐, 사연은 많았지만... 듀라 여신님은 인간과 반신들을 이끌고 악마와 싸웠어요.","source_cn":"总而言之，因为种种原因，艾雅率领人类与半神们，与恶魔作战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8D02EBF42AD8E07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1411432002":{"text":"뭐, 사연은 많았지만... 듀라 여신님은 인간과 반신들을 이끌고 악마와 싸웠어요.","source_cn":"总而言之，因为种种原因，艾雅率领人类与半神们，与恶魔作战。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8D02EBF42AD8E07","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1411432003:0":{"text":"그 전쟁은 그야말로 전례 없이 참혹했고, 수많은 악마들이 모습을 드러냈죠.","source_cn":"这场战斗的惨烈程度前所未有，无数强大的恶魔涌现于世间。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0387CCA33070D80F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1411432004:0":{"text":"그 중에서도 “흔들리는 화신”, “대지를 찢는 화약”, “광기에 찬 폭발광” <style=\"highlight\">쿠루스터</style>가 가장 유명했어요.","source_cn":"其中，“震颤的火山”“撕裂陆地的火药”“疯癫的爆炸狂”...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E1F375FAFF3D432","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1411432004":{"text":"그 중에서도 “흔들리는 화신”, “대지를 찢는 화약”, “광기에 찬 폭발광” <style=\"highlight\">쿠루스터</style>가 가장 유명했어요.","source_cn":"其中，“震颤的火山”“撕裂陆地的火药”“疯癫的爆炸狂”<style=highlight>库露丝塔</style>极为有名。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E1F375FAFF3D432","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1411432005:0":{"text":"그 악마는 타고난 광폭함과 분노로 가득한 존재였어요. 그 분노는 어디서든지 폭발하고 천지를 뒤흔들 정도였죠.","source_cn":"她天性狂躁，疯狂易怒，而这份怒火随时随地都会点燃，形成...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9B773DD5B8F7FED","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1411432006:0":{"text":"쿠루스터의 폭발에는 적도 아군도, 장소도 없었어요. 그 폭발은 모든 걸 가리지 않았거든요.","source_cn":"而她的爆炸敌我不分，也同样不分场合——事实上，她无视一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x99DC864FFA74447E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1411432007:0":{"text":"그 악마는 영원히 분노하고, 미친듯이 폭발하고, 끝없는 파멸을 가져왔어요.","source_cn":"她只是永恒地暴怒，疯狂地爆炸，带来无穷无尽的毁灭。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x07031F2B09ED2802","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1411432008:0":{"text":"그리고 어느날, 그 분노와 광기가 한계점을 넘어섰죠.","source_cn":"直到有一天，她的愤怒与疯狂达到了前所未有的程度——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x351BAABCCC31EB95","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1411432009:0":{"text":"하하하하! 이번에는 완벽한 폭발을 보여줄게!","source_cn":"啊哈哈哈哈，这次，我要带给你们完美的轰炸！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65A51B765B139FC0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1411432010:0":{"text":"이 슈퍼 폭탄은 대륙 전체를, 아니 이 세상을 모조리 날려버릴 수 있어!","source_cn":"这个超级大炸弹，能够击沉整片大陆，不，整个世界！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F6D83C851A75317","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1411432011:0":{"text":"쿠루스터의 격동적인 감정과 함께 폭탄도 극도로 커졌어요.","source_cn":"她膨胀到了极致，而那个炸弹也随着她激荡的情感膨胀到了极致。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEB0D2A24311E5663","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1411432012:0":{"text":"바로 그때, 빛나는 날개를 펼치며 거대한 검을 든 반신이 나타났습니다.","source_cn":"而此时，一位有着耀眼羽翼，手持巨剑的半神出现了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3476C07EEF8BEB4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1411432013:0":{"text":"수많은 전장을 누비며 모든 전쟁을 승리로 이끌었던 반신.","source_cn":"他曾经主宰无数战场，为千军带来辉煌的胜利。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A0E0FE915F19B48","variant_